OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 29 MAY
OL,4,G1300FCraig Charles
OL,5,     GThe weekend is basically here, so
OL,6,     GCraig is giving YOU permission to
OL,7,     Gstart the party early... That's
OL,8,     Gright, let's Down Tools with
OL,9,     GLOADS of amazing tunes to get us
OL,10,     Ggoing.
OL,11,G1600FEmily Pilbeam
OL,12,     GIt's Friday, so Emily is out to
OL,13,     Gprove that any song sounds better
OL,14,     Gwhen it's played on 6 Music by
OL,15,     GEmily Pilbeam - so let us know
OL,16,     Gwhat you want to hear.
OL,17,G1900FThe People's Party with Femi
OL,18,     FKoleoso
OL,19,     GJoe Webb, the Mercury nominated
OL,20,     Gjazz pianist and composer, shares
OL,21,     Ghis soulful Friday selections in
OL,22,     Glight of his new album Neath Beat.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
